>>
endobj
1737 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 1644 0 R
/T (Dr. Interested is a youth led global community. We help young people explore careers in wellness, take part in the policy decisions that shape their lives, and find a safe and open space to belong. We are guided by the UN Convention on the Rights of the Child \(UN CRC\), including the right to development \(Article 6\) and the right to be consulted and heard in decision making \(Article 12\). Our work also speaks to the Sustainable Development Goals \(SDGs\): SDG 4 on quality education, SDG 3 on good health and wellbeing, and SDG 10 on reduced inequalities. With 2030 fast approaching, this work matters more than ever.)
/E (Dr. Interested is a youth led global community. We help young people explore careers in wellness, take part in the policy decisions that shape their lives, and find a safe and open space to belong. We are guided by the UN Convention on the Rights of the Child \(UN CRC\), including the right to development \(Article 6\) and the right to be consulted and heard in decision making \(Article 12\). Our work also speaks to the Sustainable Development Goals \(SDGs\): SDG 4 on quality education, SDG 3 on good health and wellbeing, and SDG 10 on reduced inequalities. With 2030 fast approaching, this work matters more than ever.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
1738 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 1644 0 R
/T (In Canada alone, there are over 4 million youth aged 10 to 19. Yet nearly half are unaware of their rights. Knowing your rights is only the start. Young people also need guidance, mentorship, and spaces to grow, learn, and be heard as future leaders in wellness and beyond.)
/E (In Canada alone, there are over 4 million youth aged 10 to 19. Yet nearly half are unaware of their rights. Knowing your rights is only the start. Young people also need guidance, mentorship, and spaces to grow, learn, and be heard as future leaders in wellness and beyond.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
1739 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 1644 0 R
/T (Our three pillars)
/E (Our three pillars)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
1740 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1644 0 R
/E (We began with medicine, and we have grown well beyond it. Today we introduce youth to wellness as a whole, including health, law, finance, and any career that improves human wellbeing and quality of life. Through workshops, panels, mentorship, research and publishing opportunities, and skill building sessions, we give students early and honest exposure to these careers and the confidence to take the next step, no matter their background or prior access.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
1741 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1644 0 R
/E (2)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
1742 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1644 0 R
/E (Decisions about education, health, and the digital world are made every day, and young people are rarely in the room. Through our partnership with GLOCAL Canada and travel, micro, and technology grants, we help youth reach the places where conversations are happening, from conferences to online events. We also give them the preparation and platforms to share their opinions, interact with decision makers, and contribute their ideas to policy.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
1743 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1644 0 R
/E (3)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
1744 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 1644 0 R
/T (In a digital world that is not always safe for young people, we work to be a safe online space for youth. We run most of our work online so that anyone, anywhere, can take part. Whenever we host in person events, we aim to be a welcoming third space in the community, a place beyond home and school where youth belong and build lasting connections.)
/E (In a digital world that is not always safe for young people, we work to be a safe online space for youth. We run most of our work online so that anyone, anywhere, can take part. Whenever we host in person events, we aim to be a welcoming third space in the community, a place beyond home and school where youth belong and build lasting connections.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [21]
>>
endobj
