1786 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1645 0 R
/E (Dr. Interested started as an idea when I was just 13 years old. Growing up with a hearing disability, I faced challenges that taught me how important it is to be heard. I also saw how little career guidance was available to young people, and I realized my friends felt the same way. That is what Dr. Interested is about: making sure every youth is heard and has an equal opportunity to access education, with career education as a big part of that. Without access to career education, young people can lose motivation. Our way of empowerment is to give them that access, and to make sure they can go out, contribute to policy, and share their opinions.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [22]
>>
endobj
1787 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 1645 0 R
/T (I want to thank everyone who believed in this vision and helped bring it to life. This year, your support helped us impact)
