1788 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1645 0 R
/E (As we look toward 2027, our biggest focus will be diversification and expansion of our capabilities. The demand for our work is high. So many youth are interested, and at times we have not been able to keep up. We have already taken major steps by building a stronger back end system and diversifying our leadership team, and we will keep going as we explore more community level work around the world, beyond our international and Greater Toronto Area communities.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
