2935 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1657 0 R
/E (Through a series of chess tournaments, including the Terry Fox International and Weiss Open, Dr. Interested has raised funds in support of the Pediatric Cancer Research Fund. This initiative was created in honour of Simmon Chang, a dedicated young Canadian whose passion for chess and strength in the face of osteosarcoma continue to inspire our community. With the permission of his family, the program was renamed the Simmon Chang Chess About Cancer Club to carry forward his legacy. Within just one year, Dr. Interested became one of the top 10 fundraisers for the Pediatric Cancer Research Fund, demonstrating the power of youth-led action and community-driven impact. The initiative brought together participants, donors, and supporters united by a shared commitment to advancing pediatric cancer research and honouring Simon's life.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [94]
>>
endobj
