/Title (Dr. Interested is a youth led global community. We help young people explore careers in wellness, take part in the policy decisions that shape their lives, and find a safe and open space to belong. We are guided by the UN Convention on the Rights of the Child \(UN CRC\), including the right to development \(Article 6\) and the right to be consulted and heard in decision making \(Article 12\). Our work also speaks to the Sustainable Development Goals \(SDGs\): SDG 4 on quality education, SDG 3 on good health and wellbeing, and SDG 10 on reduced inequalities. With 2030 fast approaching, this work matters more than ever.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 9356 0 R
/Next 9511 0 R
>>
endobj
9511 0 obj
<<
/Title (In Canada alone, there are over 4 million youth aged 10 to 19. Yet nearly half are unaware of their rights. Knowing your rights is only the start. Young people also need guidance, mentorship, and spaces to grow, learn, and be heard as future leaders in wellness and beyond.)
