/Title (Students take on executive and team based roles across departments such as events, finance, human resources, marketing, publications, and technology, gaining real responsibility and impact. Our leadership model emphasizes growth, accountability, and purpose, so students leave with the confidence and skills to lead change in their schools, communities, and future careers.)
