/Title (We are committed to the safety of every young person in our community. Our Safeguarding Policy sets out how we protect youth online and in person, and concerns can be reported to hr@drinterested.org. We do not knowingly engage with youth under 13. Photos and video of participants under 18 are used only with signed parent or guardian consent. We collect only the data we need, use demographic data only in aggregate or anonymously, and will delete your data if you ask \(admin@drinterested.org\). All of our policies are written to be as child friendly as possible.)
